{"kind":"html","caption":"先统计 t = \"ABC\" 中各字符的需求量，再用右指针扩张窗口；每当 A、B、C 都达到需求时，左指针持续收缩并记录更短答案。动画展示窗口从 \"ADOBEC\" 收缩、再次扩张，最终把最优解更新为唯一的 \"BANC\"。两个指针都只向右移动，因此总时间复杂度为 O(m + n)，额外空间由字符计数表决定。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>最小覆盖子串可视化</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}*{box-sizing:border-box}.app{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:block}.panel{width:100%;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;box-shadow:none}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}.sub{margin-top:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.badge{background:#0e639c;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 7px;font-size:10px}.strings{margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}.cell{width:28px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;font:600 12px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;position:relative;transition:.35s}.cell.in{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.cell.best{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #3794ff inset}.cell.l::after,.cell.r::after{position:absolute;top:42px;font:700 9px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;color:#3794ff}.cell.l::after{content:\"左\"}.cell.r::after{content:\"右\"}.cell.l.r::after{content:\"L/R\"}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:28px}.card{background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;min-height:auto}.label{color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600}.counts{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.count{min-width:56px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;padding:6px;text-align:center}.count .ch{font:700 13px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.count .num{margin-top:4px;font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#8d8d8d}.count.ok{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c}.count.ok .num{color:#fff}.status{font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.status strong{color:#3794ff}.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;margin-top:6px;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}.bar{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff}.legend{margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"app\"><section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"top\"><div><div class=\"title\">滑动窗口寻找最小覆盖</div><div class=\"sub\">s = <span class=\"mono\">ADOBECODEBANC</span>，t = <span class=\"mono\">ABC</span></div></div><div class=\"badge\" id=\"phase\">准备计数</div></div>\n<div class=\"strings\" id=\"cells\"></div>\n<div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">窗口内计数 / 目标计数</div><div class=\"counts\" id=\"counts\"></div><div class=\"legend\">蓝色表示该字符的数量已经满足需求</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">当前决策</div><div class=\"status\" id=\"status\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\"></div></div>\n</section></main>\n<script>\nconst s='ADOBECODEBANC', need={A:1,B:1,C:1};\nconst steps=[\n {l:0,r:-1,msg:'统计目标：需要 <strong>A、B、C</strong> 各 1 个。',phase:'建立需求表'},\n {l:0,r:0,msg:'右指针读入 <strong>A</strong>，仍缺 B、C，继续扩张。',phase:'扩张窗口'},\n {l:0,r:3,msg:'右指针读入 <strong>B</strong>，仍缺 C，继续扩张。',phase:'扩张窗口'},\n {l:0,r:5,msg:'读入 C 后首次覆盖 ABC，记录候选 <strong>ADOBEC</strong>。',phase:'窗口有效',best:[0,5]},\n {l:1,r:5,msg:'移出 A 会破坏覆盖，停止收缩并继续扩张。',phase:'收缩窗口',best:[0,5]},\n {l:1,r:10,msg:'再次读入 A，窗口重新有效，可以收缩左边界。',phase:'窗口有效',best:[0,5]},\n {l:5,r:10,msg:'移除无用字符后得到 <strong>CODEBA</strong>，长度仍为 6。',phase:'持续收缩',best:[0,5]},\n {l:6,r:10,msg:'再移出 C 会破坏覆盖，转而扩张寻找下一个 C。',phase:'继续扩张',best:[0,5]},\n {l:6,r:12,msg:'读入 C 后覆盖恢复，从左侧依次移除 O、D、E。',phase:'窗口有效',best:[0,5]},\n {l:9,r:12,msg:'得到更短窗口 <strong>BANC</strong>，长度为 4，更新最优。',phase:'更新最优',best:[9,12]},\n {l:10,r:12,msg:'若继续移出 B，覆盖失效；扫描结束，答案是 <strong>BANC</strong>。',phase:'扫描完成',best:[9,12]}\n];\nconst cells=document.getElementById('cells'), counts=document.getElementById('counts');\n[...s].forEach((c,i)=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='cell';e.textContent=c;e.dataset.i=i;cells.appendChild(e)});\nObject.keys(need).forEach(c=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='count';e.id='count-'+c;e.innerHTML='<div class=\"ch\">'+c+'</div><div class=\"num\">0 / 1</div>';counts.appendChild(e)});\nlet k=0;\nfunction render(){const x=steps[k], have={A:0,B:0,C:0};if(x.r>=x.l)for(let i=x.l;i<=x.r;i++)if(s[i] in have)have[s[i]]++;\n [...cells.children].forEach((e,i)=>{e.className='cell';if(i>=x.l&&i<=x.r)e.classList.add('in');if(x.best&&i>=x.best[0]&&i<=x.best[1])e.classList.add('best');if(i===x.l&&x.r>=0)e.classList.add('l');if(i===x.r)e.classList.add('r')});\n for(const c of Object.keys(need)){const e=document.getElementById('count-'+c);e.querySelector('.num').textContent=have[c]+' / 1';e.classList.toggle('ok',have[c]>=1)}\n document.getElementById('phase').textContent=x.phase;document.getElementById('status').innerHTML=x.msg;const bar=document.getElementById('bar');bar.style.transition='none';bar.style.width=(k/(steps.length-1)*100)+'%';requestAnimationFrame(()=>bar.style.transition='width .6s ease');\n k=(k+1)%steps.length}\nrender();setInterval(render,1700);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}